WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.038
Good conversations balance speaking and listening, ask relevant questions and respect

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:05.917
other opinions.

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:11.773
Someone is speaking in a group. What is a respectful response? Answer: Listen until

00:00:11.773 --> 00:00:12.842
the speaker finishes.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.201
Discuss how to keep the school compound clean; invite a partner's different view.

00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:22.105
Discuss why: Turn-taking lets all ideas be heard.
